# cppcheck suppressions. Each entry is deliberate; see docs/TESTING.md.
# cppcheck cannot see the system headers; the message is noise, not a finding.
missingIncludeSystem
# Result<T> converts implicitly from T and from Error on purpose: `return value;` and
# `return error;` are the whole ergonomic point of the type (see ADR-0007).
noExplicitConstructor
# Google-style accessors share a name with the parameter/member they expose
# (`level(LogLevel level)`, `run(BatchRun& run)`); this is idiomatic, not shadowing.
shadowFunction
# Interface implementations keep non-static members for symmetry with the base class.
functionStatic
# Readability preference: short explicit loops over std::transform with lambdas.
useStlAlgorithm
# CurrencyCode is a four-byte trivially copyable value type; older cppcheck releases
# (2.13 on Ubuntu) flag passing it by value as a performance issue.
passedByValue
